lesson: 221
title: Days and weeks
level: primary-3
stars: 0
explain: A week has 7 days, from Monday to Sunday, and then the next week begins.
explain: To turn weeks into days, take 7 days for every week, then add the days that are left over.
explain: 3 weeks and 4 days: 3 × 7 = 21 days, and 21 + 4 = 25 days.
vars: a=name w=2..8 d=2..6
answer: w * 7 + d
exercise: {a}'s birthday party is in {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days is that?
exercise: A holiday lasts {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days long is the holiday?
exercise: {a} goes to stay with {a.his} grandmother for {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days does {a.he} stay?
exercise: A sunflower seed needs {w} weeks and {d} more days to sprout and grow its first leaves. How many days must {a} wait?
exercise: The school play is {w} weeks and {d} days away. How many days away is it?
exercise: {a} has a cast on {a.his} arm for {w} weeks and {d} days. For how many days is the cast on?
exercise: party's in {w} weeks n {d} days, how many days is that
exercise: {a} back from camp in {w} wks + {d} days?? how many days thats
exercise: holiday is {w} weeks, oh and {d} days, my mum checked. days?
exercise: we go in {w+1}, no wait {w} weeks and {d} days. how many days to wait
exercise: {w} weeks {d} days til the break, and i still got {d+2} books to read lol. how many days
test: How many days are there in {w} weeks and {d} days?
test: Counting in days, how long is a trip of {w} weeks and {d} days?
test: The swimming pool reopens {w} weeks and {d} days from today. In how many days does it reopen?
test: {a} crosses off one day on the calendar each morning. Before the trip {a.he} must cross off {w} weeks and {d} days. How many days does {a.he} cross off?
test: how many days in {w} weeks plus {d}
test: {a} reckons {w} weeks n {d} days is {w*5+d} days. whats the right number
test: The fair stays in town for {w} weeks and {d} days, and the big wheel costs {d+1} dollars a ride. How many days does the fair stay?
exam: Determine the total number of days comprised in a period of {w.words} weeks and {d.words} days.
exam: It is given that an event is scheduled to take place {w} weeks and {d} days hence. Ascertain the number of days remaining until the said event.
exam: A period of residence is stated to be of {w} weeks' and {d} days' duration. State the duration of the said period expressed solely in days.
exam: Pursuant to the school calendar, a vacation extends for {w} weeks and a further {d} days. Compute the aggregate number of days of the vacation.
exercise: Dad has been "between jobs" for {w} weeks and {d} days now. How many days is that?
exercise: {a}'s been on "garden leave" for {w} weeks n {d} days, lucky sod. how many days is that
test: Grandma passed away {w} weeks and {d} days ago. How many days ago was that?
